questions.markdown:
Compute 8-point DFT of the sequence

$$
x(n)=\begin{cases}
1, & 0 \leq n \leq 7 \\
0, & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
$$

by using decimation-in-frequency FFT algorithm.

The desired response of a low pass filter is

$$
H_d(e^{j\omega})=\begin{cases}
e^{-j3\omega} & \text{for } -\frac{3\pi}{4} \leq \omega \leq \frac{3\pi}{4} \\
0 & \text{otherwise}
\end{cases}
$$

Design the FIR low pass filter for $N=7$ using a Hamming window.
